        "id": 1000002
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-04-10T13:25:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The tags are to control the visibility in the various headers we generate. `native` is to make generate for dawn::native, https://github.com/webgpu-native/webgpu-headers but not dawn::wire. In this case we want dawn::native (and can get dawn::wire if we want).\n\n```suggestion\n            {\"value\": 66, \"name\": \"dawn allocator descriptor\", \"tags\": [\"dawn\"]}\n```",
      "revId": "dfb866828f3944e84559c4c5821f1ed8b88e2729",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
