        "id": 1004831
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-04-10T13:47:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Are you saying that `\"native\"` makes this struct get generated just for dawn::native headers while `\"dawn\"` makes this struct get generated for dawn::native and dawn::wire headers? If so what does `\"dawn\", \"native\"` do?\n\nAlso am I understanding correctly you want this struct generated in both native and wire headers?",
      "parentUuid": "de70ce61_6a253fa8",
      "revId": "dfb866828f3944e84559c4c5821f1ed8b88e2729",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f4489a16_8bbb280a",
        "filename": "src/dawn/dawn.json",
