      "lineNbr": 3848,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000002
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-04-10T13:50:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`\"native\"` makes it also generated for the \"upstream\" headers that shouldn\u0027t have Dawn-specific stuff. That\u0027s why I\u0027m suggesting changing to dawn. It isn\u0027t really an issue that this is exposed in dawn::wire as we can make the renderer process unable to use that extension (there is an allow-list in the GPU process)",
      "parentUuid": "0f27b9ef_9ede0b5d",
      "revId": "dfb866828f3944e84559c4c5821f1ed8b88e2729",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
